  "contentHtml": "<p>제가 여러 교사대상 AI연수에서&#160;</p><p>챗GPT의 기술이 이렇게 하루가 다르게 발전하고 있는 이유가</p><p>오픈AI 연구원 초봉이 86만달러 때문이라고 소개하였습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9779d6a59f6018cb3562b40f9120b677be81d631\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9779d6a59f6018cb3562b40f9120b677be81d631\" data-origin-width=\"1198\" data-origin-height=\"719\"></div><p>저는 제자들에게&#160;</p><p>연봉 2, 3억을 주는 국내기업에 취업할래,</p><p>아니면 오픈AI에 가서 3년만 일하고 와서 편안하게 살래? 라고 이야기 하기도 했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>전세계의 AI인재 영입 경쟁,&#160;</p><p>국가의 미래가 달려있습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;(출처)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/113a0c2212a8569c77e424ca4efbc3010ea26915\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" height=\"57\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/113a0c2212a8569c77e424ca4efbc3010ea26915\" data-origin-width=\"573\" data-origin-height=\"102\"></div><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/dHZAkMr0U2I?si=DWkYioFoUY_utOFs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/dHZAkMr0U2I?si=DWkYioFoUY_utOFs</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dHZAkMr0U2I\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"600\" data-video-height=\"450\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/4kzpa/hyX7TUH1kk/x0EYRldllNP3gwnCFKCqp1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=395_138_433_179,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/R2qWp/hyX7RvOMkT/nOkk9aegcuA7vuDC3BaRyk/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=395_138_433_179\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/e